%% HAND-CURATED. Race condition surfaced per plan §11: config version Δ check.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ConfigService
    participant MqttBroker
    participant Device
    participant PostgreSQL

    ConfigService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT device_configs WHERE device_id (latest config_version)
    PostgreSQL-->>ConfigService: {config_version, timestamp}
    ConfigService->>MqttBroker: Publish device/{deviceId}/config/notify {config_version, timestamp} QoS 1 (max 128 bytes, retain=false)
    alt mqtt_push_failure
        MqttBroker--xConfigService: 5xx / throttle (rate limit 100msg/sec per cohort)
        ConfigService->>ConfigService: log config_mqtt_push_failure_total — non-fatal, device catches up on 6h poll
    end

    alt device_offline_no_notify
        Note over Device: device offline at publish time — catches up on next 6h periodic poll
    else success
        MqttBroker->>Device: deliver notification
        Device->>Device: compare received config_version with local sys.last_config_version
        alt config_version_delta_check_fail (same or older)
            Note over Device: ignore — race protection against stale push on already-applied version
        else newer
            Device->>Device: schedule fetch within 5s and random jitter (avoid thundering herd)
            Device->>ConfigService: GET /v1/config/fetch (mTLS) {X-Device-Id, X-Current-Config-Version}
            ConfigService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT device_configs
            PostgreSQL-->>ConfigService: {config_blob, config_signature, config_version}
            ConfigService-->>Device: 200 {configVersion, schemaVersion, configSignature, configBlob}
            Device->>Device: verify ECDSA signature (current_key → next_key fallback), apply config
            Device->>ConfigService: POST /v1/config/applied {device_id, configVersion}
            ConfigService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE device_configs SET applied_at=now()
            ConfigService-->>Device: 204
        end
    end

    Note over ConfigService,PostgreSQL: stale_config_on_device tracked via reconciliation job (5min) · device_version Δ check prevents replay/double-apply on duplicate notify
